use... Et c'est deux-là !","language":"fr-FR"},"releaseDate":"2024-02-14","status":"Released","rating":5.7,"ratingCount":147,"genres":["Avventura","Commedia"],"countries":["France"],"facts":{"Runtime":"86m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":24893,"name":"Franck Dubosc","role":"Jack","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2sCXXZYrWSO1nGxuyVBGETj2wdE.jpg"},{"id":583687,"name":"Reem Kherici","role":"Monica","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nfOOJB41gb0aFrPxfyF3u3i4HZn.jpg"},{"id":1186076,"name":"Philippe Lacheau","role":"Brandt","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2ev0Ip2vNnC5UYe10gJNcApahZ4.jpg"},{"id":2524776,"name":"Inès Reg","role":"Diva (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nJqgnf58sZDxAE00rJkdJ3g3NLm.jpg"},{"id":1562548,"name":"Artus","role":"Chichi (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/78eYMroV3AyRJDqijnp0FSLPCgZ.jpg"},{"id":3899765,"name":"Raphaëlle Fugère-Larocque","role":"Lizzie"},{"id":3246442,"name":"Oscar Desgagnés","role":"Albert","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xUhhi2bepE6QC3tkIEjqFXWwJOo.jpg"},{"id":936196,"name":"Lenie Scoffié","role":"Soeur Ucque","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zZvCMVmODLCm7RcZMD2bIiX0bE6.jpg"},{"id":2409669,"name":"Martin Dansky","role":"Concierge","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dAgY4KD47EYDr48U53KA0CzAmM9.jpg"},{"id":1670906,"name":"Élisabeth Locas","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w81zGfP29nbMBu4UYY0TFhZ9MD3.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Cat & Dog","overview":"Una donna amante dei gatti e un ladro di gioielli uniscono le forze per ritrovare i loro animali domestici e raggiungere New York da Montreal, inseguiti da un poliziotto scontroso."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Cat and Dog","overview":"While about to take off, Monica, the owner of a famous influencer cat named Diva, and Jack, an international thief whose dog Chichi swallowed a stolen ruby, dis- cover that their pets have gotten lost on the tarmac. The owners – and their pets – must team up to find their loved ones. But they don’t know that Brandt, a cop hot on their heels, will do anything to get his hands on the ruby!"},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Monica, maîtresse de la chatte star d'internet Diva, croise à l'aéroport Jack, un voleur, accompagné du chien qui vient d'avaler le butin de son dernier casse : un rubis. Les humains sont forcés par la compagnie aérienne de mettre leurs précieux animaux en soute. Alors qu'ils sont dans l'avion ils voient par le hublot leurs animaux s'échapper de leur cage et du chariot à bagages vers une destination inconnue. Les deux duos que tout oppose s'embarquent dans un road trip contre la montre entre Montréal et New York. D'un côté, les humains qui ont perdu la trace de leurs animaux et de l'autre, les animaux livrés à eux-mêmes pour retrouver leur maître… sans savoir qu'à leur trousse, le policier Brandt est prêt à tout pour récupérer le rubis.","tagline":"Un cambrioleur, un flic, une influenceuse... Et c'est deux-là !"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wGzqk3XXpAQGlpskKP1HqRpFaPK.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rUONctvx2KhEKSPz1ybzkwu0rP.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":977331,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3SYqAvxQIddxY5Bd6sWV9Q9kMTw.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3SYqAvxQIddxY5Bd6sWV9Q9kMTw.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3SYqAvxQIddxY5Bd6sWV9Q9kMTw.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3SYqAvxQIddxY5Bd6sWV9Q9kMTw.jpg","l